+/* The Metal memory model supports 32-bit atomics on every supported device.
+ * Query values are observed after the producing stages have completed, so
+ * independent low/high additions with a carry give a full 64-bit counter
+ * without a lock or a device-dependent 64-bit atomic instruction. */
+static inline void
